<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/28/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Farmers' Organization Authority Act 1973 [Act 110], which in this Act is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended in section 17—"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/28/eng@/~cl_2__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/28/eng@/~cl_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1998/28/eng@> .
